§6.1 quoted the first-edition build of tests/fixtures/crate.werk:
413 741 B, 28 entries, 26 declared files, '26 of 26'. The pinned build
(fixtures.json crate-synthetic, checked by run_gate.py) is 684 925 B,
37 entries, 15 nodes, 35 declared files. Measured here: zipfile and
MANIFEST.json give 37 entries and 35 files; werk_read.py, werk_read.rs
and werk_read.c each verify 35 of 35. The ledger rows now cite the
pinned build and keep the old values as history.

